#13526
books stacks dozens scattered notes scrolls~
the notes and stacks of books~
Dozens of books are stacked in piles, along with scattered notes.~
   Countless books, scrolls, and scraps of paper are piled about the area, some
in an alcove and some just sitting upon the stone floor. The books range from
quite old to pristinely new. Some are labeled as histories, others as spell
books. Oddly, though, you cannot lift or move any of them. Some magic affixes
them permanently in place. Here and there, the stubs of long-burnt candles sit
on the edge of the alcove, atop stacks of books, and on the floor.
Some of the texts you can see are:
   Tome of Arthropod Embiggening
   Spell to hex a person into a rat
~
